[
{
"content_id": "313331",
"reference_id": 108983,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "歌羅西書 1:1–14",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "51001001-51001014",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p><data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232760\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">以巴弗</data>曾在歌羅西與人分享關於<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232820\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">耶穌</data>的<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232644\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">福音</data>。然後他去見<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232703\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">保羅</data>，並告訴他歌羅西<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232678\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">信徒</data>的情況。歌羅西人對耶穌有堅定的<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232833\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">信心</data>，並對彼此有深厚的愛。這是基於<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232903\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">神的子民</data>將來從他那裡所要得到的盼望。保羅稱信心、盼望和愛為福音結的果實。當關於耶穌的真理被傳講時，它就會改變那些接受它的人。人們開始以<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232800\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">神</data>喜悅的方式思考、說話和行事。這就是保羅所說的果實。保羅為歌羅西信徒所做的<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232828\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">禱告</data>是他們能夠繼續結出果實。這包括忍耐和感謝神。這包括有<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232926\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">智慧</data>和理解力，並認識神。這些為他們在<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"233162\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">神的國度</data>中與耶穌永遠生活在一起做好了準備。</p>",
