{
"content_id": "313332",
"reference_id": 108984,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "歌羅西書 1:15–23",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "51001015-51001023",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>保羅準確描述了耶穌是誰以及祂所做的事。耶穌是神，祂向人們展示了神的樣子。<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232699\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">基督</data>是一切存在的起點。祂賦予萬物意義。甚至<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"233024\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">靈性存在</data>也是由祂創造的。保羅將耶穌描述為身體的頭。他指的是<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232744\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">基督的身體</data>和<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232697\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">教會</data>。這意味著耶穌是教會的領袖，信徒必須效法祂的榜樣。將來信徒會像耶穌一樣從死裡復活。這就是<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"233169\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">復活</data>。他們將擁有不會被毀滅的生命。基督的死給神和祂的<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232798\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">創造</data>重新帶下<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232812\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">和平</data>。當耶穌在<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"233131\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">十字架</data>上捨命時，祂終止了<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"232796\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\" data-language=\"zht\">罪</data>的勢力。那些信靠基督的人擺脫了罪的責備和罪惡。保羅鼓勵歌羅西人繼續在福音帶來的盼望中堅強成長。</p>",
